== summon orbs, fruits...), so each level shows its own name
== instead of a generic "Item +N".
== Loaded by GameServer via cCItemLevel::LoadXML().
== Modify only if you know what you're doing!
============================================================

### ItemLevel::Config ###
	Section     Item section (0-15, matches Item.xml).
	ItemIndex   Item sub-index within that section (matches Item.xml).
	Level       The item's level (+0, +1, ...) this name applies to.
	Name        Display name shown for this item at this specific level.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

